* Z3PLUS - LOAD OR REMOVE THE Z-SYSTEM

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* Z3PLUS - LOAD OR REMOVE THE Z-SYSTEM

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    A0:Z3PLUS [ON|SMALL|LARGE|OFF]

Installs or changes the Z3PLUS command environment using its configured
library modules. ON loads it; SMALL/LARGE select memory configurations;
OFF removes it when possible.

Used by the installed boot sequence. Changing packages while BYE or other
resident services are active can invalidate their environment. Use the
host launcher for normal operation and test package changes on stopped
copied disks.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
